4. Wrapped the component in all necessary providers in the correct order based on the stack trace

5. Added proper TypeScript imports for all providers

6. Added a wrapper div with full width to ensure proper rendering

This should resolve the dynamic import error and provide all the necessary context providers that the component needs to function properly. If you encounter any specific provider-related errors after this, please let me know and I can help adjust the configuration further.

